additional_info.summary:
18 actions are divided into three categories:
Wearing a mask: Wear The Mask;
Mask-wearing related actions: Adjust The Mask, Pull On The Mask, Pull Down The Mask, Pull On One Rope, Pull Down One Rope;
Actions that may mislead mask-wearing status estimation: Remove The Mask, Rubbing Eyes, Rubbing The Nose, Rubbing The Hair, Put On A Hat, Take Off The Hat, Put On The Earphones, Take Off The Earphones, Wear Glasses, Push The Glasses, Take Off The Glasses, Wiping Mouth;

